item+ trait crates/lattice-core/src/coordinate_ext.rs :: CoordinateNav :: pub trait CoordinateNav { :: [UPSTREAM] Navigation trait: move forward/backward in a specific dimension. The existing break methods (scroll_break, section_break, etc.) advance AND reset lower dimensions. That's correct for parsing delimiters, but an editor also needs "move to the next book without resetting chapter/section/scroll" for lattice navigation, AND "move backward" which libphext doesn't support at all. `navigate` moves in a dimension, resetting lower dims (like the delimiter does). `peek` moves in a dimension WITHOUT resetting lower dims (for UI preview). :: direct :: api
