item+ function crates/lattice-core/src/search.rs :: build_index_parallel :: pub fn build_index_parallel(buffer: &[u8], chunk_size: usize) -> LatticeIndex { :: Parallel index build — partition the buffer into chunks, scan each for delimiter boundaries, then merge. For very large phexts (>100MB) where the O(n) sequential scan becomes noticeable. Currently unused — sequential build is ~30ms for 4.26 MB which is already below perceptual threshold. Included for future scaling. :: direct :: api
item~ function crates/lattice-core/src/search.rs :: search_lattice :: pub fn search_lattice( buffer: &[u8], index: &LatticeIndex, pattern: &str, case_sensitive: bool, max_results: usize, ) -> Vec<SearchHit> { :: Search the lattice for a text pattern (single-threaded). Returns hits in document order (by coordinate). :: direct :: api
