item+ function crates/lattice-core/src/search.rs :: search_lattice_parallel :: pub fn search_lattice_parallel( buffer: &[u8], index: &LatticeIndex, pattern: &str, case_sensitive: bool, max_results: usize, ) -> Vec<SearchHit> { :: Search the lattice for a text pattern across all available cores. Uses rayon's work-stealing thread pool. Each scroll is a work unit — scrolls are independent so there's zero contention. Results are collected per-thread then merged in coordinate order. Falls back to serial for small lattices (< PARALLEL_THRESHOLD scrolls) where thread synchronization cost exceeds the parallelism benefit. :: direct :: api
